1
00:00:00,553 --> 00:00:02,483
(Bernadette:)Why does this bother you so much?

2
00:00:02,689 --> 00:00:06,419
(Penny:)I don't know. It's just, he's so passionate
about so many different things.

3
00:00:06,626 --> 00:00:08,656
(Penny:)I just don't get that way. Do you?

4
00:00:08,861 --> 00:00:11,801
(Bernadette:)Well, sure.
I'm pretty passionate about science.

5
00:00:11,998 --> 00:00:16,488
(Bernadette:)I remember the first time I looked through
a microscope and saw tiny microorganisms.

6
00:00:16,703 --> 00:00:18,833
(Bernadette:)It was like a whole other universe.

7
00:00:19,038 --> 00:00:23,338
(Bernadette:)If I wanted to, I could wipe it out
with my thumb like a god.

8
00:00:25,311 --> 00:00:27,471
See, I wish I had
some of that fire in my life.

9
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:30,980
I wanna care about things
and get excited like you guys.

10
00:00:31,184 --> 00:00:33,514
(Bernadette:)- There's no reason you can't.
- You think?

11
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:38,180
Absolutely. All we need to do is spend time
and find something you're passionate about.

12
00:00:38,991 --> 00:00:41,691
(Penny:)Ugh, that sounds like a lot of work.

13
00:00:46,365 --> 00:00:47,595
(Howard(onwebcam):)Hey, what's up?

14
00:00:47,834 --> 00:00:49,824
(Raj:)Lucy's coming over. I need some advice.

15
00:00:50,036 --> 00:00:53,866
(Howard:)However long you think
the foreplay should be, triple it.

16
00:00:56,342 --> 00:00:58,772
(Raj:)Just tell me which one you think
is more manly.

17
00:00:59,011 --> 00:01:04,021
This hockey jersey or this football jersey?

